  PadForge's own raw HID writes follow its Windows backend. HIDAPI offers
  three licenses, and PadForge uses its BSD-style license (LICENSE-bsd.txt).
  Licensed under that BSD-style license, the BSD 3-Clause terms reproduced
  at the end of this file

