libusb
  https://github.com/libusb/libusb
  USB access library used by the bundled SDL3 fork for the Switch 2 Pro
  wired driver and the controllers PadForge binds to WinUSB. Ships
  unmodified inside the executable as libusb-1.0.dll, extracted on startup
  and loaded dynamically by the SDL3 fork. Source code for the shipped
  binary is available at the project page above, and PadForge's own source
  is public, so the executable can be rebuilt against a modified libusb.
  Licensed under the GNU Lesser General Public License v2.1 or later
  (full text below)

