  libwinpthread-1.dll is the mingw-w64 winpthreads library, Copyright (c)
  the mingw-w64 project. The three arrive with the Vosk package as the
  native runtime the x64 libvosk needs and ship unmodified inside the
  executable. The ARM64 libvosk.dll is built with llvm-mingw and carries
  its runtime inside itself: the mingw-w64 runtime and winpthreads under
