  licensed under the Apache License 2.0 with LLVM Exceptions.
  libgcc and libstdc++ are licensed under the GNU General Public License
  v3 with the GCC Runtime Library Exception v3.1. libwinpthread is
  licensed under the mingw-w64 winpthreads license (MIT-style terms).

